# Sequential strict let* semantics: intermediate bindings are forced to WHNF at bind time.
# An unused binding in a fn-body Sequential still errors eagerly (strict let*).
# To suppress, use $if or wrap in a lazy dict passed through ---.
[test: [fn [x] [unused: [error "should not be evaluated"]] [+ x 1]]]
[test 41]
=== error
[E080] should not be evaluated
